    "specialkeywords" -> {}, "tutorialcollectionlinks" -> {}, "index" -> True,
     "label" -> "Eric James Parfitt/ Cyclic Tag Compiler Symbol", "language" -> 
    "en", "paclet" -> "EricJamesParfitt/CyclicTagCompiler", "status" -> 
    "None", "summary" -> 
    "NaryCyclicTag [{ rule1, rule2 , ...}, init, t] gives a list of the tapes \
in t steps of the n-ary cyclic tag system that uses the rules rulei in turn, \
starting from the tape init. NaryCyclicTag [{ rule1, rule2 , ...}, init, t, \
prop] gives the property prop for each step of the evolution. NaryCyclicTag \
[{ rule1, rule2 , ...}, init, t , { prop1, \\ prop2 , ...}] gives a list of \
the properties propi for each step.", "synonyms" -> {}, "tabletags" -> {}, 
